ters.\", \"line\": 4, \"span\": \"a group of easy to remember letters\"}, {\"text\": \"BIP 39 consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed.\", \"line\": 6, \"span\": \"It consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed.\"}, {\"text\": \"The seed generated by BIP 39 can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\", \"line\": 6, \"span\": \"This seed can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\"}, {\"text\": \"BIP 39 falls under the GPL License.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"This BIP falls under the GPL License.\"}, {\"text\": \"A mnemonic sentence could be written on paper.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"}, {\"text\": \"A mnemonic sentence could be spoken over the telephone.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"}, {\"text\": \"The guide is not a way to process user-created sentences into a wallet seed.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"It's not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet süeed.\"}, {\"text\": \"User-created sentences are also known as brainwallets.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"also known as brainwallets\"}]}","ttft_ms":5515,"type":"result","duration_ms":5552,"uuid":"829b1cb4-2403-4cd7-8436-e995073ce04c","ttft_stream_ms":1669,"time_to_request_ms":116,"first_content_frame_ms":1669,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
